{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/gateway-porto-al-zorah-development-al-zorah-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":732,"crm_id":"855","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Gateway Porto","slug":"gateway-porto-al-zorah-development-al-zorah-city","display_address":"Al Zorah City","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Al Zorah Development","price":868856,"display_price":"868K","lattitude":25.4291339,"longitude":55.4511397,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Gateway Porto - a luxury development by Al-Zorah, is a residential building consisting of 157 simple and duplex apartments. The development seamlessly blends modern living with a deep connection to the environment, promoting life amidst excellent air quality due to its proximity to the thriving mangrove forest of the Al Zorah Nature Reserve.</p><p>The stunning two-building residential complex includes a courtyard designed to allow natural light and ventilation through large skylights. The complex features apartments ranging from <strong>studios to 1-3 bedrooms.</strong></p><p>Gateway Porto provides homeowners with exclusive access to golf, beach clubs, hotel services and marina. Residents can also enjoy a host of activities, from diving and kayaking along the beachfront to walking along scenic trails against a backdrop of vibrant mangroves.</p><p>Residents can also enjoy a wide range of sports and recreational offerings just steps away from the complex. These include a swimming pool, multi-purpose and gymnasium, golf course, beach club and Oberoi Beach Resort.</p><p>Strategically located just 25 minutes from Dubai International Airport, Gateway Porto Al Zorah provides residents with convenient global connectivity while immersing them in tranquil surroundings. This landmark development on the Ajman coast is also in close proximity to the under-construction Wynn Casino in Ras Al Khaimah.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/geR7DkHWDOmHODrP3U3NEbdqTZJ6NZlxuwkinTR6.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/02/geR7DkHWDOmHODrP3U3NEbdqTZJ6NZlxuwkinTR6.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/iXSvfr8MRQ2K1OS2Ed9HCFrRvhocQbnqNoxkH5yZ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/02/iXSvfr8MRQ2K1OS2Ed9HCFrRvhocQbnqNoxkH5yZ.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/855/images/2024/02/02/9G2BT6t22JZanQNTC0CCmf5gu58JmIUc62WtNgit.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/02/9G2BT6t22JZanQNTC0CCmf5gu58JmIUc62WtNgit.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2961,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/02/02/LVNID2YKhR55MNeoBclkHfFi2oMT2fVcA1uIso6X.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":806,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":2238,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2239,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2240,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2241,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Studio","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"","payment_plans":[{"id":38